    extra field mime_type (silently dropped by pydantic extra="allow"), so the
    returned resource carried mimeType=None. Now passes the SDK field mimeType
    and wraps the uri in AnyUrl.
  * Simplify the mcp v1/v2 FastMCP compat shim to a direct import; the old
    self-import always failed and fell through to the same source anyway.
  * Add missing module/package/class/function docstrings; document Returns:/
    Args: on MCP-exposed tools, resources and prompts (their docstrings are
    served verbatim to MCP clients as descriptions).
